  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION kClosest(points, k):\n    minHeap = []\n    FOR x, y IN points DO:\n        dist = x^2 + y^2\n        PUSH [dist, x, y] TO minHeap\n    END FOR\n    BUILD_HEAP(minHeap), res = []\n    FOR i FROM 1 TO k DO:\n        [dist, x, y] = POP(minHeap)\n        APPEND [x, y] TO res\n    END FOR\n    RETURN res\nEND FUNCTION",
